                            </div>
                            <div class="section">
                                <div class="terms-description">
                                    <p>
                                        StayPrivate Services is used by many <span data-word="organization">organization</span>s and individuals around the world, and we appreciate the trust you have placed and continue to place in us to protect your information. In return, we trust you to use StayPrivate Services responsibly.
                                    </p>
                                    <p>
                                        You agree not to misuse StayPrivate Services. For example, you must not, and must not attempt to do the following:
